3. Strict Prohibitions (Anti-Cloning & IP Protection)
-----------------------------------------------------
Without a separate written commercial license agreement from Licensor, you MAY NOT:
  (a) Commercial Use: Use the model, its weights, cognitive runtime, or its outputs for
      any commercial, revenue-generating, or production business purpose.
  (b) Redistribution & Hosting: Redistribute, sublicense, publish, sell, lease, or
      host the model or adapter weights as a managed service or API for third parties.
  (c) Model Cloning, Distillation, or Synthetic Training: Use the model, its weights,
      logits, hidden states, or generated outputs to train, fine-tune, distill, or
      evaluate any other machine learning model or competing AI system.
  (d) Reverse Engineering: Attempt to extract, reconstruct, or reverse-engineer the
      proprietary KL-GRPO training mixture, replay dataset recipes, cognitive verifiers,
      or watermarked weights.

